From da14fcd182d1d94296187fc26cf22ef28bb5eff8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZCode <zcode@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:33:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Android: ADB debug control surface (census, servos, stream,
 load-save)

Patch 0012, all additive (earlier patches' hunks stay byte-identical):
- androiddebug.cpp/hpp (new TU): per-frame tick with on-device servo
  primitives (turn-to-yaw, face-nearest-hint-actor, walk with
  blocked-stop), all-axes JOY_STATE hold, scene census (doors of the
  current cell + nearest actors with bearing/distance/state), MyGUI
  focus dump, per-Nth-frame streaming telemetry, save loading by path.
- Player::activate records each attempt's outcome (act= in STATE).
- OPENMW_DEBUG_NO_IDLECAM=1 disables the Lua idle-orbit camera.
- Kotlin DebugInputReceiver: SERVO/STREAM/LOAD_SAVE/JOY_STATE actions,
  STATE answers from both the legacy poll and the new tick.
